        <item>
            <title>3.4.3</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 12:45:46 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/sj719045032/claude-statistics</link>
            <sparkle:version>3.4.3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.4.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's New

- Show Claude task progress in the Notch with clearer status and icon colors.
- Track Claude TaskCreate/TaskUpdate events more reliably so completed task lists disappear instead of staying stale.
- Improve Codex hook feature compatibility with the newer hooks flag.
- Restore local SDK path changes after debug runs to keep release packaging clean.

## 中文

- Notch 现在会显示 Claude 当前任务进度，并补齐更清晰的状态和图标颜色。
- 更可靠地跟踪 Claude 的 TaskCreate/TaskUpdate 事件，任务全部完成后列表会及时消失，不再停留在旧进度。
- 改进 Codex hook feature 兼容性，适配新版 hooks 开关。
- debug 脚本运行后会恢复本地 SDK path 改动，避免影响发布打包。
]]></description>
